District white ratio: r = TotalW / Total

Decision Variables:
x_{s,n}^W ≥ 0 : number of white students from neighborhood n assigned to school s
x_{s,n}^{NW} ≥ 0 : number of nonwhite students from neighborhood n assigned to school s

